==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Divine Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Dober]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] and an anti-Angel CC unit like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] wins this stage with no effort. In most strategies, you want Angel Cyclone alive for Dark Lazer to continuously snipe the backline with her Wave Attacks.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Ascendant Dioramos]]: Can both Knockback and Slow the Divine Cyclone and St. Dober while dealing very high DPS.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: Deals heavy damage to [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Darks]] and [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] from a decent range. While vulnerable to Surge Attack, still proves to be a strong pick for this stage.
*[[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]]: a powerful Uber who can shred Angels, stay just out of the way of St. Dober's Surge Attack and, with luck, avoid or tank Tackey's attacks.

